<!DOCTYPE qhelp PUBLIC "-//Semmle//qhelp//EN" "qhelp.dtd">
<qhelp>
<overview>
<p>This opt-in review query identifies Java source calls whose resolved target is
the parameterless <code>java.lang.String.intern()</code> method. It uses the
CodeQL Java method binding, so comments, string literals and unrelated methods
named <code>intern</code> do not match.</p>
<p>A finding records use of the API. It does not establish a security defect,
incorrect result, memory leak or performance regression.</p>
</overview>
<recommendation>
<p>Review the intended string-pool policy and measure the application's workload.
Record intentional use when appropriate. Before changing a call, consider whether
the program relies on canonical string identity or reference equality. This query
does not supply an automatic fix.</p>
</recommendation>
</qhelp>
